('A profile with HDMI sends the sound to a projector or TV. For Bluetooth headphones "High Fidelity Playback (A2DP)" sounds best; "Headset" is for calls with the microphone.', 'Um perfil com HDMI envia o som para um projetor ou televisor. Para auscultadores Bluetooth "High Fidelity Playback (A2DP)" soa melhor; "Headset" é para chamadas com o microfone.', 'Profil dengan HDMI mengirim suara ke proyektor atau TV. Untuk headphone Bluetooth, "High Fidelity Playback (A2DP)" terdengar paling baik; "Headset" untuk panggilan dengan mikrofon.', 'Perfíl ho HDMI haruka son ba projetór ka televizaun. Ba auskultadór Bluetooth, "High Fidelity Playback (A2DP)" mak di\'ak liu; "Headset" ba telefone ho mikrofone.'),
