('Clear sound uses a little processor time while sound plays; "Off" stops EasyEffects completely. EasyEffects is made by Wellington Wallace and others (GPL-3.0). The presets "Laptop speakers", "Loudness", "Headphones" and "Bass" are by JackHack96 (EasyEffects-Presets, MIT License).', 'O som nítido usa um pouco do processador enquanto toca som; "Desligado" para o EasyEffects por completo. O EasyEffects é feito por Wellington Wallace e outros (GPL-3.0). As predefinições "Altifalantes de portátil", "Loudness", "Auscultadores" e "Graves" são de JackHack96 (EasyEffects-Presets, licença MIT).', 'Suara jernih memakai sedikit waktu prosesor saat suara diputar; "Mati" menghentikan EasyEffects sepenuhnya. EasyEffects dibuat oleh Wellington Wallace dan lainnya (GPL-3.0). Preset "Speaker laptop", "Loudness", "Headphone" dan "Bass" dibuat oleh JackHack96 (EasyEffects-Presets, Lisensi MIT).', 'Son moos uza prosesadór uitoan bainhira son toka; "Mate" hapara EasyEffects tomak. EasyEffects halo husi Wellington Wallace no seluk (GPL-3.0). Prekonfigurasaun "Altifalante laptop", "Loudness", "Auskultadór" no "Baixu" husi JackHack96 (EasyEffects-Presets, lisensa MIT).'),
