('Eduka-Pastel (the default): the soft blue of the Edukasaun OS logo with cute colored badges, big raised round cards and pill buttons; light and friendly for school.', 'Eduka-Pastel (o predefinido): o azul suave do logótipo do Edukasaun OS com emblemas coloridos e simpáticos, cartões redondos grandes e elevados e botões em forma de pílula; claro e amigável para a escola.', 'Eduka-Pastel (bawaan): biru lembut logo Edukasaun OS dengan lencana berwarna yang lucu, kartu bulat besar yang timbul dan tombol berbentuk pil; terang dan ramah untuk sekolah.', "Eduka-Pastel (padraun): azul mamar husi logo Edukasaun OS ho emblema kór oioin ne'ebé furak, kartaun kabuar boot no butaun hanesan pílula; naroman no amigavel ba eskola."),
('Frosted glass: blur behind Eduka-Panel, Eduka-Desktop and their popups (needs 3D graphics; off in VirtualBox)', 'Vidro fosco: desfoque atrás do Eduka-Panel, do Eduka-Desktop e das suas janelas (precisa de gráficos 3D; desligado no VirtualBox)', 'Kaca buram: efek blur di belakang Eduka-Panel, Eduka-Desktop dan popup-nya (perlu grafis 3D; mati di VirtualBox)', "Vidru kabuar: blur iha Eduka-Panel, Eduka-Desktop no nia popup kotuk (presiza gráfiku 3D; mate iha VirtualBox)"),
